# Raw collector sink from a capture run — tens of MB of repeated batches.
# The curated, de-duplicated evidence lives in the checked-in *.jsonl files
# alongside this, and README.md says what each one proves. Regenerate these
# by re-running the rig; never commit them.
# A glob, not a list: every rig lane writes its own raw_<lane>/ and the
# explicit list kept falling behind new lanes -- raw_quad's 36MB sink was
# tracked for weeks because nobody updated it.
raw/
raw2/
raw_*/
